/**
 * generate-sd-series-omni-videos.mjs
 *
 * Re-shoots the damaged clips across all six Design X episodes.
 *
 * These series shipped with footage generated by a tool whose prompts were not
 * kept, so every shot here is written fresh. Only the damaged ones are listed —
 * the five clean middle shots and all twelve intro/outro shots are untouched
 * and deliberately absent from this file.
 *
 * The scripts are not touched at all. Narration, titles and card copy stay
 * exactly as authored; this file changes only what the camera sees.
 *
 * What was wrong, and what each rewrite avoids:
 *   · a `a publication wordmark` wordmark burned into fifteen of them — never name a publication
 *   · invented lettering (`Dayitnase Valle`, `COMLER SHAKE`, `DOQUICEOR PRIE'Y`,
 *     `SAD FASD`, `BLIOB 15-DEO`) — abstract shapes invite it, concrete objects
 *     do not
 *   · third-party brand marks (a wall of NVIDIA logos) — same cause as the
 *     wordmark: naming a company makes the model draw its logo
 *   · live-action photography of real hands and desks — the flat-2D sentence in
 *     the shared STYLE block is what prevents this
 *
 * Run:  node scripts/ccaf/generate-sd-series-omni-videos.mjs [clipId...]
 *       node scripts/ccaf/generate-sd-series-omni-videos.mjs --sheet
 */

